                    <th class="px-4 py-4 font-bold text-gray-600 text-sm">Black Jack Drive-Maxx 1000</th>
                    <th class="px-4 py-4 font-bold text-gray-600 text-sm">Latex-ite Ultra Shield</th>
                  </tr>
